config BR2_PACKAGE_OPENBAO
	bool "openbao"
	help
	  SPIKE ONLY (geekdojo/geekdojo-brain#677): the stock OpenBao
	  release binary, installed to /usr/bin/bao so the image and OTA
	  growth can be measured. Not enabled by any defconfig and not a
	  decision to ship OpenBao (that is #687, S3).

	  https://openbao.org
